<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17240" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex-spergo</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex-spargo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">experg-</span></b> ), no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, spersus, 3, v. a.
			spargo, <i>to sprinkle</i>, <i>scatter abroad</i>, <i>disperse</i>
				(<b>poet.</b>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exspargi quo possint moenia mundi,</span>”
				<i>to be dispersed</i>, <i>diffused</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 371</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sanieque exspersa natarent Limina,</span>”
				i. e. <i>besprinkled</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 3, 625</span></i>
			 (Rib. aspersa).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
